    "final_report_title": "研究报告：Java 虚拟线程在哪个 JDK 版本正式发布，synchronized 导致的线程固定问题在哪个版本改善？引用 JEP。",
    "final_report_markdown": "# Java 虚拟线程的正式版本与 synchronized 固定问题改善\n\nJava 虚拟线程在 JDK 21 成为正式功能，并引用 JEP 444；synchronized 导致的线程固定问题已在 Java 24 中得到改善，相关修改已集成到 JDK 24 早期访问构建中。\n\n## 直接回答\n\n虚拟线程在 JDK 21 成为正式功能，相关改进已实现，使其成为永久性功能。 [evidence:da8f0fe314b9e35d22063695eb9fc4ff527cd2dc2329e59c]\n\n针对 synchronized 引起的线程固定问题的改进已于 Java 24 完成，并已包含在最新的 JDK 24 早期访问构建中。 [evidence:61a37f843cb9100dc6e033b0ab2e5c976bb4cc1693030df8]\n\n## Citation audit\n\n### Java virtual threads · JDK version improving synchronized pinning\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:61a37f843cb9100dc6e033b0ab2e5c976bb4cc1693030df8`\n- Exact quote: “This change is already integrated into Java 24 and available in the latest JDK 24 EA builds.”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/0867bb24-25a1-4302-9621-c6cff8abd7ba/91900e212db2abde3a86fe6484b91c222d13dec007b9feb4c0319d442df07116`\n- URL: https://inside.java/2024/11/21/newscast-80/\n\n### Java virtual threads · JDK version where virtual threads became final\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:da8f0fe314b9e35d22063695eb9fc4ff527cd2dc2329e59c`\n- Exact quote: “With those improvements now implemented, virtual threads became a permanent JDK feature with Java 21.”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/21ac04be-8640-4b57-9d85-516b764e6524/e658823460be5d10d19c53b29dcd84b6142c6b497aecbffad9fea5fbd616b359`\n- URL: https://www.jrebel.com/blog/what-are-virtual-threads\n\n",
